# Session Management Patterns

## Direct Access Pattern

Always use underlying classes directly instead of delegation methods:

```python
# ✅ Correct - Direct access
session_manager.sessions.get_session_by_id(APP_3GPP_GX, session_id)
session_manager.subscribers.get_subscriber_by_msisdn(msisdn)

# ❌ Avoid - Delegation methods (removed)
session_manager.get_session_by_id(APP_3GPP_GX, session_id)
```

## Session Creation Flow

### Automatic Session Creation
```python
# SessionManager automatically creates sessions for these message types
CREATE_SESSION_MESSAGES = [CCR_I, AAR, SLR]

# Process message - session created automatically if needed
session_manager.process_diameter_message(diameter_message)
```

### Session Lookup Methods
```python
# By session ID
session = session_manager.sessions.get_session_by_id(APP_3GPP_GX, session_id)

# By framed IP (Gx only)
session = session_manager.sessions.get_session_by_framed_ip(APP_3GPP_GX, ip_address)

# By MSISDN (Gx only)
session = session_manager.sessions.get_session_by_msisdn(APP_3GPP_GX, msisdn)
```

## RxSession-GxSession Binding

### Automatic Binding Process
```python
def stage_bind_rx_to_gx(self, rx_session: RxSession, dm: DiameterMessage):
    # Try framed IP first
    if hasattr(dm.message, 'framed_ip_address') and dm.message.framed_ip_address:
        gx_session = self.sessions.get_session_by_framed_ip(APP_3GPP_GX, dm.message.framed_ip_address)
        if gx_session:
            rx_session.gx_session_id = gx_session.session_id
            return
    
    # Try MSISDN fallback
    if hasattr(dm.message, 'subscription_id') and dm.message.subscription_id:
        msisdn, imsi, _, _, _ = parse_subscription_id(dm.message.subscription_id)
        if msisdn:
            gx_session = self.sessions.get_session_by_msisdn(APP_3GPP_GX, msisdn)
            if gx_session:
                rx_session.gx_session_id = gx_session.session_id
                return
```

